    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow rv">§ 01 · The gods we use</span>
      <p class="lede rv d1" style="margin-top:clamp(1.2rem,2vw,2rem)">Everyone alive right now is reaching for the most ridiculous and magnificent collection of gods imaginable, just to get through this century.</p>
      <p class="megaquote rv d1"><span class="a">Not the gods we</span> <span class="b">believe in.</span> <span class="a">The gods we</span> <span class="b">use.</span></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PICASSO BAND -->
