    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow on-dark rv">§ 02 · What Guernica becomes</span>
      <p class="big rv d1" style="margin-top:clamp(1.2rem,2vw,2rem)">Picasso painted one war, one town, one canvas. This is what Guernica becomes when every war is visible at once, and no one can look away.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PLATES -->
